{"$schema": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/guitaripod/wwdc-sessions/master/schema/transcript.schema.json", "id": "wwdc2017-250", "language": "eng", "source": "https://developer.apple.com/videos/play/wwdc2017/250", "wordCount": 611, "segments": [{"start": 17.0, "text": "What are deep links, and how"}, {"start": 19.0, "text": "can they be used to extend the"}, {"start": 20.0, "text": "presence of your app?"}, {"start": 22.0, "text": "Let's start with your app."}, {"start": 23.0, "text": "It consists of information like"}, {"start": 25.0, "text": "videos, photos, or maybe places"}, {"start": 27.0, "text": "and locations, as well as"}, {"start": 29.0, "text": "functions like watching a video,"}, {"start": 30.0, "text": "getting directions, or sharing"}, {"start": 32.0, "text": "information."}, {"start": 33.0, "text": "The typical user experience"}, {"start": 34.0, "text": "involves knowing that the"}, {"start": 35.0, "text": "content or function exists in"}, {"start": 37.0, "text": "your app; then, navigating"}, {"start": 38.0, "text": "through some hierarchy of use in"}, {"start": 40.0, "text": "order to find it."}, {"start": 41.0, "text": "This is called the user journey"}, {"start": 43.0, "text": "or user activity."}, {"start": 45.0, "text": "Deep links are a way to offer"}, {"start": 46.0, "text": "direct access to the content and"}, {"start": 48.0, "text": "functions in your app."}, {"start": 50.0, "text": "The way it works is your app is"}, {"start": 51.0, "text": "launched, you receive a link,"}, {"start": 53.0, "text": "and the app displays the"}, {"start": 54.0, "text": "content."}, {"start": 55.0, "text": "The same can be done to complete"}, {"start": 57.0, "text": "a function in your app"}, {"start": 58.0, "text": "automatically."}, {"start": 60.0, "text": "Here's an example of launching a"}, {"start": 61.0, "text": "video from a deep link."}, {"start": 63.0, "text": "Note the transitions to orient"}, {"start": 65.0, "text": "the user where they are within"}, {"start": 66.0, "text": "the app."}, {"start": 67.0, "text": "This helps the user establish"}, {"start": 69.0, "text": "their place and subtly reminds"}, {"start": 71.0, "text": "them of how they can navigate"}, {"start": 72.0, "text": "back."}, {"start": 74.0, "text": "The way you format a deep link"}, {"start": 75.0, "text": "is called a Universal Link."}, {"start": 78.0, "text": "This is a secure mapping that"}, {"start": 79.0, "text": "launches your app."}, {"start": 81.0, "text": "Best of all, they are universal,"}, {"start": 83.0, "text": "and if your app is not"}, {"start": 84.0, "text": "installed, it can always fall"}, {"start": 85.0, "text": "back to Safari."}, {"start": 87.0, "text": "Here's what it looks like."}, {"start": 89.0, "text": "You have a scheme like https, a"}, {"start": 91.0, "text": "domain, which is the same as"}, {"start": 93.0, "text": "your website, and a path to the"}, {"start": 94.0, "text": "resource."}, {"start": 96.0, "text": "The way you get started with"}, {"start": 98.0, "text": "Deep Links is you add an"}, {"start": 99.0, "text": "entitlement for all web domains"}, {"start": 101.0, "text": "that your app supports."}, {"start": 102.0, "text": "You create an app-site"}, {"start": 104.0, "text": "association file, which is an"}, {"start": 105.0, "text": "adjacent file which contains"}, {"start": 106.0, "text": "data about the URLs that your"}, {"start": 108.0, "text": "app can handle."}, {"start": 109.0, "text": "You then upload that"}, {"start": 110.0, "text": "app-site-association file to"}, {"start": 111.0, "text": "your web server and implement"}, {"start": 113.0, "text": "the continueUserActivity method"}, {"start": 114.0, "text": "in your App Delegate."}, {"start": 115.0, "text": "This will pass you a"}, {"start": 117.0, "text": "UserActivity object, which will"}, {"start": 118.0, "text": "contain a URL for your Universal"}, {"start": 120.0, "text": "Link."}, {"start": 122.0, "text": "There are many times you are"}, {"start": 123.0, "text": "going to want a deep link to"}, {"start": 124.0, "text": "somewhere in your app, and by"}, {"start": 126.0, "text": "using Universal Links, you have"}, {"start": 128.0, "text": "one clean and simple way of"}, {"start": 129.0, "text": "doing that."}, {"start": 130.0, "text": "This presents many opportunities"}, {"start": 131.0, "text": "to help new users discover your"}, {"start": 133.0, "text": "app through its content."}, {"start": 135.0, "text": "For example, you can enable a"}, {"start": 137.0, "text": "user to share content on social"}, {"start": 138.0, "text": "media, in messaging or email"}, {"start": 140.0, "text": "with Universal Link."}, {"start": 142.0, "text": "You can create those links on"}, {"start": 144.0, "text": "the web, on your website, or"}, {"start": 145.0, "text": "others can link to it from their"}, {"start": 146.0, "text": "website, and it can be"}, {"start": 148.0, "text": "catalogued in Search like"}, {"start": 150.0, "text": "Spotlight."}, {"start": 151.0, "text": "Universal Links are also a way"}, {"start": 153.0, "text": "to encourage more engagement of"}, {"start": 155.0, "text": "you app."}, {"start": 156.0, "text": "The first way is to have your"}, {"start": 157.0, "text": "app be recommended in Siri App"}, {"start": 158.0, "text": "Suggestions and Hand Off by"}, {"start": 160.0, "text": "registering your own"}, {"start": 161.0, "text": "NSUserActivities."}, {"start": 164.0, "text": "You can create Deep Links in a"}, {"start": 165.0, "text": "lock screen, which to make your"}, {"start": 166.0, "text": "content, just a swipe and tap"}, {"start": 168.0, "text": "away."}, {"start": 170.0, "text": "You can launch straight to the"}, {"start": 171.0, "text": "content of your app from the App"}, {"start": 172.0, "text": "icon with Quick Actions."}, {"start": 175.0, "text": "If your app contains content"}, {"start": 176.0, "text": "supported by SiriKit, you can"}, {"start": 177.0, "text": "map these to Universal Links."}, {"start": 180.0, "text": "Other apps can contain your"}, {"start": 181.0, "text": "Universal Links, which can pass"}, {"start": 183.0, "text": "information to your app."}, {"start": 185.0, "text": "If you integrate with the TV"}, {"start": 187.0, "text": "app, then you can use Universal"}, {"start": 188.0, "text": "Links."}, {"start": 189.0, "text": "A caveat here is that animation"}, {"start": 191.0, "text": "is not necessary because the"}, {"start": 193.0, "text": "system readies the interface for"}, {"start": 194.0, "text": "video content before launching"}, {"start": 195.0, "text": "your app."}, {"start": 198.0, "text": "So, in summary, create Deep"}, {"start": 199.0, "text": "Links to all the app's content"}, {"start": 201.0, "text": "and functions that it makes"}, {"start": 202.0, "text": "sense for; create a catalog of"}, {"start": 204.0, "text": "these using Universal Links;"}, {"start": 206.0, "text": "expose all your links to"}, {"start": 208.0, "text": "increase discoverability and"}, {"start": 209.0, "text": "engagement of your content."}, {"start": 212.0, "text": "Finally, when launching a"}, {"start": 213.0, "text": "Universal Link, use animation to"}, {"start": 214.0, "text": "help keep the user oriented."}, {"start": 217.0, "text": "For more information, see the"}, {"start": 218.0, "text": "resource section of this video."}]}
